WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:04.590
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright Is Banned

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.960
from the Foundation Holiday Party!

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:11.019
Every year, the SCP Foundation gives their
staff a break from all the monsters and mayhem

00:00:11.019 --> 00:00:14.410
and throws a little holiday shindig so everyone
can blow off some steam!

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:21.070
It’s a pretty nice affair, shrimp cocktail,
open bar, and they put a Santa hat on SCP-999.

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:26.000
But after the “zombie reindeer” incident
of 2014, Dr. Bright is barred from participating

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.230
in the holiday merriment.

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:30.500
He just can’t be trusted after he’s gotten
into the egg nog.

